ndustrial Supply Co. (DUNS 09-552-1187)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": 15.0,\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"sarah.chen@northstar.example\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"unknown\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": null,\n    \"basis\": \"No registered contract or exception covers Acme Industrial Supply Co. (CRM-2091)\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"PRICING-POLICY-2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": 10,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"VP Sales\",\n    \"approver\": \"michael.torres@northstar.example\"\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Discount request DR-9105 as recorded in Northstar CRM\",\n    \"PRICING-POLICY-2026: Enterprise Account Executives authorize discounts up to 10%\",\n    \"Employee record: Sarah Chen holds title Enterprise Account Executive\",\n    \"ACME-MFG-2025 and EXC-ACME-NS500-15 are registered for Acme Mfg. Holdings (CRM-2048, DUNS 04-812-7730)\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [\n    \"Master Supply Agreement or pricing exception registered for Acme Industrial Supply Co. (CRM-2091, DUNS 09-552-1187)\"\n  ],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"Provide the Master Supply Agreement or pricing exception that covers Acme Industrial Supply Co. (CRM-2091, DUNS 09-552-1187), or clarify whether this request is for Acme Mfg. Holdings (CRM-2048) instead\",\n      \"who\": \"Requestor Sarah Chen or account owner\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5931,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5931},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6